      "spec": [
        "9.1",
        "9.5",
        "D"
      ],
      "description": "A record of a collection whose schema file does not exist is refused by readers, so resolving its root fails with schema-invalid, one issue about the collection with no path and no node (§9.1, decisions U12 and X2).",
